[sliver] The marked face is a vertical root or flank of the same 2 mm pitch tooth profile used by pulley-80t, through the full 7 mm belt land. Its narrow planar width defines the belt-engagement profile; radial material backs the face. This sector is the physical fit coupon for the purchased 6 mm belt. Accept actual engagement without forcing or damaged flanks before accepting the six complete pulleys.
